    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as for you, teach what befits sound doctrine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bid the older men be temperate, serious, sensible, sound in faith, in love, and in steadfastness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bid the older women likewise to be reverent in behavior, not to be slanderers or slaves to drink; they are to teach what is good, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and so train the young women to love their husbands and children, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to be sensible, chaste, domestic, kind, and submissive to their husbands, that the word of God may not be discredited. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likewise urge the younger men to control themselves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Show yourself in all respects a model of good deeds, and in your teaching show integrity, gravity, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and sound speech that cannot be censured, so that an opponent may be put to shame, having nothing evil to say of us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bid slaves to be submissive to their masters and to give satisfaction in every respect; they are not to be refractory, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nor to pilfer, but to show entire and true fidelity, so that in everything they may adorn the doctrine of God our Savior.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the grace of God has appeared for the salvation of all men, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "training us to renounce irreligion and worldly passions, and to live sober, upright, and godly lives in this world, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awaiting our blessed hope, the appearing of the glory of our great God and Savior",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of the great God and our Savior",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesus Christ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
